# Diamond Grade .dockerignore
# Exclude local virtual environments and caches
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
**/.git
**/.github
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Exclude large local data
brain/qdrant_db/
brain/applications/

# Exclude local documentation and logs
*.log
*.m4a
walkthrough.md
audit_report.md
implementation_plan.md
task.md
verify_phase3.py
verify_diamond.py
tests/
